---
// Floating circular photos + doodles, positioned to match the template (1440 canvas)
const floaters = [
  { file: "74DpwWvKPwaHemMYBszkeIFSlVM.png", size: 138, top: 91, left: 77 },
  { file: "MucmjTJJ0P7Fl73awJwD19PLx0.png", size: 138, top: 67, left: 1127 },
  { file: "cYqgolaVLMmWTSwarCoHme7iXT8.png", size: 138, top: 289, left: 1266 },
  { file: "RoXQ3J7vvoQQGqJPm8W9nsxw6J0.png", size: 143, top: 481, left: 141 },
  { file: "tsIad10819yKvFUBsa3eVSXJmA.png", size: 138, top: 523, left: 1072 },
];
---

<section class="relative min-h-[720px] overflow-hidden bg-cream">
  <!-- Floating circular photos (anchored to a centered 1440 canvas) -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 hidden lg:block">
    <div class="relative mx-auto h-full w-[1440px] max-w-full">
      {
        floaters.map((f, i) => (
          <img
            src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/${f.file}`}
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
            data-reveal="scale"
            data-reveal-delay={0.1 + i * 0.08}
            class="absolute rounded-full object-cover shadow-sm"
            style={`top:${f.top}px; left:${f.left}px; width:${f.size}px; height:${f.size}px`}
          />
        ))
      }
      <!-- Doodles -->
      <img
        src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/bp8cD6ZRWiiFkH9hCPMVYrST3Q.svg`}
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute h-[39px] w-[46px]"
        style="top:120px; left:1071px"
      />
      <img
        src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/qi6XErSOH5xNf7R979ZatYl9rPE.svg`}
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute h-[37px] w-[45px]"
        style="top:461px; left:107px"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Centered content -->
  <div class="container-site relative z-10 flex min-h-[720px] flex-col items-center justify-center py-24 text-center">
    <h2
      data-reveal
      class="font-display text-[40px] leading-[1.05] text-forest sm:text-[56px] lg:text-[72px] lg:leading-[76px]"
      style="max-width:930px"
    >
      Émerveillement, amitié, nature et souvenirs pour la vie
    </h2>
    <p
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.1"
      class="mt-6 max-w-[900px] font-heading text-[20px] leading-[32px] text-moss"
    >
      Chaque séjour est une occasion d'explorer, de tisser des liens et de créer
      des souvenirs inoubliables, tout en se faisant des amis, en découvrant de
      nouvelles passions et en s'émerveillant devant la beauté de la nature.
    </p>
    <a
      href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}camps`}
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.18"
      class="group relative mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-orange px-8 py-[18px]"
    >
      <span class="relative z-10 font-heading text-[20px] font-bold text-white">
        Découvrir nos activités
      </span>
      <span
        class="absolute inset-0 z-0 origin-bottom scale-y-0 bg-[#e05200] transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-y-100"
      >
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
